+---
+
+Implemented the long-rental reward from task `task-003-reward-longer-rentals`. The shared quote
+calculation applies a 10% discount when the rental is at least three days, rounding the discounted
+total to the nearest euro cent. Since bookings use the quote result, quote and booking totals match.
+Updated the README and exported API documentation to describe the discount.
